WEBVTT

00:11:26.557 --> 00:11:30.060
We can expand this success story
to the rest of marine life,

00:11:30.102 --> 00:11:33.814
and last year, we published a paper
in the journal "Nature,"

00:11:33.814 --> 00:11:36.608
where we pledged
that it's possible to recover

00:11:36.650 --> 00:11:40.362
and rebuild the abundance of life
in the ocean by 2050.

00:11:41.155 --> 00:11:44.283
Just imagine that it is within our [grasp]

00:11:44.283 --> 00:11:48.412
to hand over a healthy ocean
to our children and grandchildren.

00:11:48.454 --> 00:11:49.955
And as we do so,

00:11:49.955 --> 00:11:54.376
we can also step up in our race
to stabilize our climate.

00:11:54.418 --> 00:11:55.586
Thank you.

00:11:55.586 --> 00:11:58.756
(Cheers and applause)